    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fatebound</strong> is a turn-based kingdom-building strategy game where every decision shapes the destiny of your realm. Starting from humble beginnings as a small town, you\u2019ll expand, develop, and rise to greatness\u2014if you can navigate the challenges fate throws your way. Manage your resources, construct vital buildings, and carefully spend your limited action points each turn to strengthen your kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <strong>Fatebound</strong> is full of unpredictability. Dynamic events, both good and bad, can drastically alter the flow of the game, challenging you to adapt your strategy on the fly. Seasons shift, affecting resource production and altering the effectiveness of your plans, as you balance growth with survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn based actions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each turn, the fate of your kingdom is in your hands\u2014will you guide it to a prosperous empire, or will your choices doom it to collapse? In <strong>Fatebound Kingdoms</strong>, the future is yours to shape, but fate is always watching.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather Resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources through workshops or use single action points to gather them directly from available world sources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262650/extras/3f93117986d53ebe82a057ee6563aef9.poster.avif?t=1730896443\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262650/extras/3f93117986d53ebe82a057ee6563aef9.webm?t=1730896443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262650/extras/3f93117986d53ebe82a057ee6563aef9.mp4?t=1730896443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Automation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate your kingdom to gather resources for you automatically, letting you collect the resources you need daily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262650/extras/5aff1cd35d02b97b4f9f1ee7677f331d.poster.avif?t=1730896443\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262650/extras/5aff1cd35d02b97b4f9f1ee7677f331d.webm?t=1730896443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262650/extras/5aff1cd35d02b97b4f9f1ee7677f331d.mp4?t=1730896443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
